# select_branch_ready — select over multiple operations
# (README §16). Tests multiplexing async operations.

SelectBranchReady is project
SelectBranchReady module examplesSelectBranchReady
SelectBranchReady target console
SelectBranchReady entry main

examplesSelectBranchReady is module
examplesSelectBranchReady path examples.selectBranchReady
examplesSelectBranchReady exports main
examplesSelectBranchReady purpose "Demonstrate select branch ready"
examplesSelectBranchReady invariant "Select multiplexing works"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap no
main async yes
main purpose "Select over async operations"
main invariant "Select works"

main let ready immutable Int64 1
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0

main do printReady
main return okCode

printReady is call
printReady in main
printReady invokes console.writeIntegerLine
printReady arg value Int64 ready
